cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these data, please cite the article and this archive."
title: "Code and data release for \"When a compliance score rewards the wrong adjustment: auditing grid-code forecast assessment in China's wind sector\""
abstract: >-
  Final pipelines, per-iteration traces and farm-level result tables from three
  years of an automated post-processing loop on a provincial Chinese wind fleet
  (106 floored runs, 32 holdout runs and 32 runs with installed capacity as the
  objective denominator; 5,360 planned iterations, 5,200 executed, 1,202 accepted
  code edits), with the scripts that reproduce every table and figure of the
  accompanying manuscript. Artefacts for 138 of the 170 runs are included.
